1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 14]

34
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,790
Rebels?

35
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,000
Sir.

36
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:50,590
Could it be

37
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,270
Yun Shao?

38
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,040
Whoever planted the Gu

39
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,230
has made no move yet.

40
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,430
Maybe they're planning another trap.

41
00:02:02,170 --> 00:02:03,120
- Commander Xiao.
- Commander Xiao.

42
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,080
Carry on.

43
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,560
Sir.

44
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,430
You're no longer with the Fengyi Bureau.

45
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:17,910
No need to salute me.

46
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:19,680
Sir.

47
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,430
Brother, get up.

48
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,870
Don't kneel.

49
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:24,560
Get up.

50
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,750
Now that you're leading the rebels,

51
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,400
we're enemies.

52
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,680
We're only meeting today

53
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,190
to exchange info.

54
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:39,680
Nothing more.

55
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,400
I need to find this man.

56
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,630
He was a miner at the Blood Jade Mine

57
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,190
and vanished 18 years ago.

58
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,400
Yes.

59
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,280
I will find him at once, my lord.

60
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:54,560
Xiao Ruoming.

61
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,750
You're no longer

62
00:02:57,970 --> 00:02:58,760
with the Fengyi Bureau.

63
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:00,870
You should

64
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:03,960
stop calling me that.

65
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,960
I have something else to report.

66
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:14,750
Ruoli found a secret tunnel
at Mingyu Headquarters.

67
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,000
It leads

68
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,190
to the back of Xing'en Temple.

69
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:31,280
Sir.

70
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,430
This is the altar behind Xing'en Temple.

71
00:03:50,870 --> 00:03:52,190
Strange.

72
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:54,000
What is?

73
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,520
Mingyu used ordinary white jade,

74
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,800
but this is blood jade.

75
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,080
Why would the Yuns
sacrifice Yun Shao with blood jade?

76
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,430
Right.

77
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:08,240
Blood-jade rituals are only for royalty.

78
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,000
Could it be...

79
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,400
I'm going to see His Majesty.

80
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,510
[Illustrious Virtue]
Your Majesty.

81
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,440
Please take a closer look.

82
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,190
Does she remind you of someone?

83
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:20,360
Well...

84
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,830
My eyesight is failing.

85
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,000
I can barely see.

86
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,920
You came to see me

87
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,320
just to show me

88
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:29,000
this portrait?

89
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:29,750
Your Majesty.

90
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,240
Please look carefully.

91
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:00,920
Pei Zhao.

92
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:04,000
Where did you get

93
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:07,120
this portrait of the Empress
before her marriage?

94
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:09,070
Are you certain, Your Majesty,

95
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,680
that this is the Empress?

96
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,510
The late Empress and I grew up together.

97
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,630
How could I not recognize her?

98
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:18,040
Do you have a portrait of her?

99
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,070
I'd like to see it.

100
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,310
How dare you?

101
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,160
Don't mistake my trust

102
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,160
for permission to overstep.

103
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:29,360
Your Majesty.

104
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,430
The woman in this portrait

105
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,600
is the younger Lady Yun,

106
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,190
Yun Shao.

107
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,190
She's the same age as the Crown Prince.

108
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,680
On the day of his Blood Jade Ritual,

109
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,190
the Yuns were draining Yun Shao's blood

110
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,160
with blood-jade hairpins.

111
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,510
Yun Shao escaped,

112
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:44,120
and the Crown Prince's ritual failed.

113
00:05:49,070 --> 00:05:50,270
I'll give you a secret edict.

114
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,920
Find out what happened.

115
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,070
If anyone tampered
with the royal bloodline,

116
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:55,920
show no mercy.

117
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:56,750
Yes.

118
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:18,190
On the day of his Blood Jade Ritual,

119
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,800
the Yuns were draining Yun Shao's blood

120
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,950
with blood-jade hairpins.

121
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,480
Yun Shao escaped,

122
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,960
and the Crown Prince's ritual failed.

123
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:25,640
I'll give you a secret edict.

124
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,480
Find out what happened.

125
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:30,200
If anyone tampered
with the royal bloodline,

126
00:06:30,310 --> 00:06:31,360
show no mercy.

127
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,120
Father.

128
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,830
Lord Pei.

129
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:36,640
Lord Yun.

130
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,490
I'm here to take Lady Yun

131
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,610
to the Fengyi Bureau for questioning.

132
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:41,700
Shao just returned.

133
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,540
Her mother cannot bear to part with her.

134
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,070
Bring her back early

135
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,330
after you're done.

136
00:06:49,810 --> 00:06:50,930
Master, bad news.

137
00:06:53,270 --> 00:06:54,120
Master.

138
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,360
The Young Master was attacked.

139
00:06:55,570 --> 00:06:56,950
They just found him outside the city,

140
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:58,800
covered in blood.

141
00:06:59,150 --> 00:06:59,890
Hurry.

142
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:02,870
You did it?

143
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,160
If I had,

144
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,360
I'd have done it here.

145
00:07:05,890 --> 00:07:07,600
Then which hero did?

146
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,870
I should thank him.

147
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,310
Six months ago,

148
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:16,000
the capital began such rites.

149
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:19,190
Young nobles gathered at night,

150
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,250
cut girls and bleed them into wine.

151
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:25,000
Yun Qi was especially fond of it.

152
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,360
He often hosted

153
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,750
Blood Banquets.

154
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,630
What an animal.

155
00:07:31,810 --> 00:07:32,560
Unfortunately,

156
00:07:33,350 --> 00:07:35,310
none of those nobles will testify.

157
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:37,600
And with all this attention,

158
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:40,480
Yun Qi won't risk another Blood Banquet.

159
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:48,690
Here.

160
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:50,640
Our gallant hero.

161
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,180
Next time,

162
00:07:53,690 --> 00:07:54,910
cover your tracks better.

163
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,560
So you found my pendant.

164
00:07:58,310 --> 00:08:00,080
Madam Yun made this herself.

165
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,190
I can't lose it.

166
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,390
That explains it.

167
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:04,760
So our Chang'an beat up Yun Qi.

168
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,120
That weakling?

169
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,950
I only hit him five times

170
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,820
and he started crying.

171
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,830
And someone like that

172
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,530
commands the garrison?

173
00:08:15,810 --> 00:08:16,560
Enough.

174
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:17,700
Stop bragging.

175
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,870
Go play.

176
00:08:19,190 --> 00:08:21,170
Madam Yun and I
have business to discuss.

177
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:24,570
General Chang'an, take care.

178
00:08:29,380 --> 00:08:29,740
Sir.

179
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,840
Do you

180
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,500
have business with me?

181
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,690
There's a wishing tree

182
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,770
east of the city.

183
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:50,870
I'd like

184
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,140
to take you there.

185
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:56,090
To make a wish?

186
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:02,820
[Fortune]

187
00:09:31,850 --> 00:09:32,880
You have wishes too?

188
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:36,910
No.

189
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:38,480
Like you,

190
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:40,820
I want to find those innocent girls.

191
00:09:43,490 --> 00:09:45,460
If every official in Yong were like you,

192
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,440
the people would be blessed.

193
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,390
When the ruler is virtuous,

194
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:51,200
the people may prosper.

195
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:53,770
Speaking of the ruler in public?

196
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,720
Someone may report you.

197
00:09:58,470 --> 00:10:00,210
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

198
00:10:00,710 --> 00:10:05,150
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

199
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,420
- Let's go.
- Sir, you're blushing.

200
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,240
I'm not.

201
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,320
Why would I?

202
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,150
You are.

203
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:10,630
Here.

204
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:11,480
Here.

205
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,360
And here.

206
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,320
Stop it.

207
00:10:21,150 --> 00:10:21,680
Fine.

208
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,080
You were kept inside since childhood.

209
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,570
Do you remember much?

210
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,550
Did anyone unusual visit you?

211
00:10:42,890 --> 00:10:44,360
Did anyone give you anything special?

212
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,320
No.

213
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,320
I stayed in the back courtyard

214
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,320
and rarely went to the front.

215
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,010
Animals.

216
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:52,470
Sir.

217
00:10:52,850 --> 00:10:54,030
You're acting strange today.

218
00:10:54,330 --> 00:10:55,250
Is something bothering you?

219
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,240
I went to where you were sacrificed.

220
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,750
Is this yours?

221
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:07,510
Mother gave it to me
for my Flowering Rite.

222
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,000
You call this a gift?

223
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,800
Hey.

224
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,270
Don't throw it away.

225
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,320
Blood jade is valuable.

226
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,240
We could sell it.

227
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:19,240
It's filthy.

228
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,030
Don't wear it.

229
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,600
If you want blood-jade jewelry,

230
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,390
I'll buy you some.

231
00:11:22,550 --> 00:11:23,440
Oh.

232
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,320
Sir, madam.

233
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:25,670
You mustn't say such things.

234
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:27,270
Blood Jade must not be bought or sold.

235
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:29,360
Why not look at these accessories?

236
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:31,550
All the latest styles from the capital.

237
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,740
We're not buying Blood Jade.

238
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:34,000
Just looking.

239
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,120
Pack them all.

240
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:37,200
Right away.

241
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:40,180
You really spoil your wife.

242
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:45,620
Wait.

243
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,120
Not that one.

244
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:50,600
Sir, don't throw it away.

245
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,240
I can sell it

246
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,960
to someone else.

247
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,910
It's bright red.

248
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,480
No one should wear it.

249
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,010
Getting upset?

250
00:12:07,650 --> 00:12:08,630
Don't be.

251
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:16,260
[Tablet of My Lost Son]

252
00:12:23,390 --> 00:12:24,840
Why won't my son come

253
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,960
to me in dreams?

254
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,200
Let me see you once more.

255
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,080
Your Highness.

256
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,510
The Crown Prince is here.

257
00:12:51,550 --> 00:12:52,850
Greetings, Mother Consort.

258
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:55,090
Perfect timing.

259
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:57,540
I had some portraits sent over

260
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,070
of ladies of marriageable age.

261
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,390
See if any please you.

262
00:13:05,990 --> 00:13:06,530
Mother Consort.

263
00:13:07,740 --> 00:13:08,440
There's already

264
00:13:08,710 --> 00:13:09,900
someone I like.

265
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,440
Please help me marry her.

266
00:13:11,630 --> 00:13:12,320
Is that so?

267
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,670
Which family's daughter?

268
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:14,390
Tell me.

269
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:15,750
The younger Lady Yun.

270
00:13:15,830 --> 00:13:16,420
Yun Shao.

271
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:19,720
Have you lost your senses?

272
00:13:20,370 --> 00:13:22,240
She was abducted by ruffians.

273
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,550
Her reputation is ruined.

274
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:24,840
How can she be Crown Princess?

275
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,760
I will wed no one but her.

276
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,360
Calm yourself, Your Highness.

277
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:37,550
Your Highness.

278
00:13:37,550 --> 00:13:38,690
Prince of Xin'an has arrived.

279
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:42,670
All of you, leave.

280
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,200
Why such anger?

281
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,750
It's bad for your health.

282
00:14:14,190 --> 00:14:15,670
I thought you'd never

283
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,790
come see me again.

284
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:17,910
I wouldn't dare.

285
00:14:18,130 --> 00:14:19,100
I value my head.

286
00:14:20,390 --> 00:14:21,960
So you are afraid of something.

287
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:27,550
You've got some nerve.

288
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,360
You've been back this long

289
00:14:29,410 --> 00:14:30,790
and haven't visited once.

290
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,120
What?

291
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,250
Think you don't need

292
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:36,810
my support anymore?

293
00:14:39,210 --> 00:14:40,120
I've been busy

294
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:42,900
with you

295
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:44,910
and the Crown Prince.

296
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:48,600
Go.

297
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:51,090
Kill Yun Shao for me.

298
00:14:52,670 --> 00:14:53,960
Because

299
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:56,150
the Crown Prince wants to marry her?

300
00:14:57,750 --> 00:14:58,840
You know already?

301
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:02,240
Do you have spies

302
00:15:02,530 --> 00:15:03,670
around me?

303
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,480
You were shouting so loudly.

304
00:15:07,620 --> 00:15:09,200
I heard you from outside the palace.

305
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,910
Calm down.

306
00:15:15,350 --> 00:15:16,630
I say

307
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:19,150
just let him marry her.

308
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:22,390
Once Yun Shao enters the Eastern Palace,

309
00:15:23,310 --> 00:15:24,560
she'll be under your control.

310
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:29,000
After the Blood Jade Ritual,

311
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,010
you can dispose of her

312
00:15:31,570 --> 00:15:32,600
however you please.

313
00:15:38,450 --> 00:15:39,850
That mind of yours

314
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:41,960
does come in handy.

315
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:55,910
Your Majesty.

316
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:57,540
You've said lately

317
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,000
that your vision is failing.

318
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,120
I've prepared a medicinal decoction

319
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,080
to help your eyes.

320
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:05,840
Even the imperial physicians

321
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:08,480
can't help my eyes.

322
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:10,240
A few sips of decoction?

323
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:11,940
What good will that do?

324
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,320
Tell me.

325
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,240
What is it?

326
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:20,570
You may all leave.

327
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:27,320
Qingyan came to me.

328
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,630
He said he likes a woman

329
00:16:29,630 --> 00:16:31,000
and wants to marry her.

330
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:35,570
Which family is she from?

331
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,440
The younger Lady Yun.

332
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,270
Yun Shao.

333
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,240
The woman in this portrait

334
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,630
is the younger Lady Yun,

335
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:43,200
Yun Shao.

336
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:51,080
Her?

337
00:16:52,390 --> 00:16:54,600
I'm not trying to benefit the Yuns.

338
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,360
This was Qingyan's own idea.

339
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,270
He's always

340
00:17:06,270 --> 00:17:07,680
been good and obedient.

341
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:10,960
This is the first time

342
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,720
he's ever asked me for anything.

343
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:15,590
I couldn't refuse him.

344
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:17,440
I thought

345
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:20,200
if the late Empress were watching,

346
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,550
she wouldn't want Qingyan unhappy.

347
00:17:24,190 --> 00:17:25,360
I plan

348
00:17:25,370 --> 00:17:27,960
to make Yun Shao a junior consort

349
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:30,240
and grant Qingyan his wish.

350
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,240
Later,

351
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,920
we can choose someone suitable

352
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,960
as Crown Princess.

353
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,200
Would that be acceptable?

354
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:46,350
Your Majesty.

355
00:17:46,870 --> 00:17:49,200
The third of next month is auspicious.

356
00:17:49,650 --> 00:17:50,830
I was thinking

357
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,920
of holding the Crown Prince's

358
00:17:52,930 --> 00:17:53,790
and Pei Zhao's weddings together.

359
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:56,680
Yun Qi has little talent.

360
00:17:57,020 --> 00:17:58,260
We can't rely on him later.

361
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,840
But Pei Zhao is different.

362
00:18:00,410 --> 00:18:01,590
He's brave and clever.

363
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,860
Once they are in-laws,

364
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:05,310
Pei Zhao will

365
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,790
devote himself

366
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,310
to the Crown Prince.

367
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,720
Go back for now.

368
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:19,830
Let me think about it.

369
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:48,590
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

370
00:18:50,210 --> 00:18:53,400
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

371
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,460
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

372
00:18:56,960 --> 00:19:01,400
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

373
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:06,230
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

374
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:12,460
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

375
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:20,810
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

376
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:29,700
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

377
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:38,370
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

378
00:19:38,750 --> 00:19:47,620
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

379
00:19:48,050 --> 00:19:56,540
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
